    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Gift for Dad",
      "",
      "Today is Father’s Day. I want to give my dad a gift. I really like playing basketball.",
      "I hope that Dad and I can go together to see a game, so I want to give him tickets to a basketball game.",
      "I don’t know how to buy tickets. Dad knows how to buy tickets, but he is too busy, and never has any time.",
      "So I drew him a robot. I want the robot to help Dad work.",
      "That way, he will be able to play basketball and go and see the game with me!"
    ]
